title: temprun richer retry demo
date: 2026-08-29
status: settled

claims:
  - id: research-workflow-has-six-fake-agents
    text: The current fake plan fans out to web, papers, systems, implementation, security, and critic agents.
  - id: failure-injection-is-per-agent-attempt-count
    text: ResearchRequest.fail_agent_attempts can make multiple agents fail for configurable attempt counts before succeeding.

changes:
  - Expanded the fake research plan from three agents to six agents.
  - Added per-agent controlled failure counts while preserving the earlier fail_agent_once field.
  - Raised workflow Activity RetryPolicy maximum_attempts to four so two planned failures can recover.
  - Updated the static demo to show six agents and scenario-based multi-failure retries.
  - Added Temporal tests for the multi-agent, multi-failure retry path.

verification:
  - PYTHONPATH=. .venv311/bin/python -m pytest
  - node --check docs/app.js
  - npx --yes playwright@1.57.0 screenshot --viewport-size=1280,900 http://127.0.0.1:8790/ /tmp/temprun-demo.png
